 te.gov
UID:BD3D0144-4858-42C6-B48D-82C952E0CA26
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=je
 well.john@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:jewell.john@gmail.com
CREATED:20191016T123033Z
DESCRIPTION:Added a physical location of the TA Lab for those who are in th
 e office.\n\n\n\nLet’s touch base on our meeting with the USSFCU and talk t
 hrough 2020 at a high level to gauge everyone’s thoughts and decide on some
  directions with which to move forward.\n\n\n\nLet me know if this time doe
 sn’t work for you. I did this based on free/busy in outlook\, but admittedl
 y I don’t have that for JJ anymore. ☹\n\n\n\nEither way\, I look forward to
  seeing everyone soon.\n\nJDub\n\n\n\n\nCHIGT 2020 and follow-up from our U
 SSCU meeting\n\n\nWednesday\, October 16\, 2019\, 10:00 AM | 30 min\n\n\n(U
 TC-05:00) Eastern Time (US & Canada)\n\n\nAn agenda has not been added for 
 this meeting\n\n\nJoin Using Telepresence\n\n\nVideo address (use when call
 ing from a video system\, Jabber or Skype for Business):139@vtc.senate.gov<
 sip:139@vtc.senate.gov>\n\n\nJoin using web browser - Copy and paste the fo
 llowing link into your web browser (chrome recommended): https://join.senat
 e.gov/invited.sf?id=139&secret=944f2bf5-4e9c-4bcd-b27b-3168a3783da7\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230104T130256Z
LOCATION:Join Reservation \; SAA TA LAB (SAA)\, Join Reservation\, SAA TA L
 AB (SAA)
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CHIGT 2020 and follow-up from our USSCU meeting
