DESCRIPTION:Good afternoon\,\n\nPlease join us for a tour of the Sliwinski 
 Water Treatment Plant!  As Eric shared last night\, the Pre-30-Day Performa
 nce Testing is underway.  This tour will be an opportunity to see the plant
  in operation for the first time.  Breakfast will be provided.\n\nPlease le
 t me know if you have any questions.  I hope to see everyone there!\n\nWarm
  regards\,\n\nJamie McFadden\n
