 ow. ***\n\nFolks\,\n\nHemangi will be leaving the SAA after 13yrs of servic
 e on February 25th. This is an invite to celebrate and catch up. Come if yo
 u feel comfortable being in a crowd\, she will understand if you aren’t abl
 e to make it.\n\nThe Wunder Garten will be the HH spot. If the weather is b
 ad… rainy and cold\, the HH will be moved to Penn Social in Chinatown. Plea
 se look out for meeting update if the weather does change.\n\nHope to see y
 ou there.\n\nRich\n
