DESCRIPTION:Good morning\, John\,\n\nMy apologies for the late notice!  I’m
  so used to sending you the Board meeting agendas\, I forgot to include you
  in this distribution.\nThe Frederick Water Planning Committee meeting is t
 his afternoon at 4:00 PM\, with the option to attend in person or virtually
 .\n\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.  I apologize again for t
 he delay!\n\nJamie\n\n-----Original Appointment-----\nFrom: Jamie Miller\nS
 ent: Wednesday\, March 30\, 2022 1:29 PM\nTo: Jamie Miller\; wyatt.pearson@
 fcva.us\; GreyWolfe\; Greg Unger\; Kevin Kenney\; Ronald A. Mislowsky\, (RM
 islowsky@Pennoni.com)\; LARRY ATKINSON\; Henry Sliwinski\nCc: Angela Mason\
 ; Cheryl Whittle\; Craig Grubb\; Daniel Legge\; Earl Wiley\; Michael Newlin
 \; Rocky Stump\; Greg L. Grim\; Eric R. Lawrence\nSubject: Frederick Water 
 Planning Committee Meeting\nWhen: Monday\, April 4\, 2022 4:00 PM-5:00 PM (
 UTC-05:00) Eastern Time (US & Canada).\nWhere: Microsoft Teams Meeting\n\nG
 ood afternoon Frederick Water Planning Committee members.\n\nThe Planning C
 ommittee will meet on Monday\, April 4\, 2022\, at 4:00PM\, in the Frederic
 k Water Board Room.  Virtual participation via Microsoft Teams is available
  via the link below.\n\nThe meeting agenda is attached for your review.\n\n
 Warm regards\,\n\nJamie Miller\n___________________________________________
