DESCRIPTION:Hello John\, Juergen and Bophamony –\n\nThank you for taking ti
 me to talk about HP’s Security Suite with John Jewell and I on May 3rd at 4
 pm EST.\n\nJohn retired as the CIO from the Senate and is helping a number 
 of the Legislative Accounts with their Security awareness.\n\nWe would like
  to review HP’s Security Suite offering as it pertains to the Enterprise an
 d the safety of End Point Devices.\n\nThank you!\n\nWendy\nHP Inc.\n703-641
 -8310\n\n[https://st2.zoom.us/static/94180/image/new/ZoomLogo_110_25.png]<h
 ttp://zoom.com/>\n[https://seeklogo.com/images/H/hp-logo-EEECF99DCE-seeklog
 o.com.png]<http://hp.com/>\nClick Here to join your Meeting <https://hp.zoo
 m.com/j/96302601523?pwd=WFlON2YxL0hsNEUrTSt1QVFQVmJLQT09>\nPassword:\n47877
 6\nJoin from a Zoom Room:\n963 0260 1523\nPlease use computer audio or the 
 mobile phone app's device audio option whenever possible.\nTo Dial in (if r
 equired):\n+1 646 876 9923 (US Toll) or +1 669 900 6833 (US Toll)\nPassword
 :\n478776\nClick here for International numbers<https://hp.zoom.com/u/acsE7
 qUQNL>\n\nFor more information please visit HPNOW<https://hpitprod.service-
 now.com/hp?id=hpi_home> and search for Zoom\n\n\n\n
