DESCRIPTION:\nTopic: Internal LoC Discussion\nDate: Wednesday\, July 29\, 2
 020\nTime: 10:00 am\, (UTC-04:00) Eastern Time (US & Canada) \n\n----------
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ----------\nTo join the audio portion of the Personal Conference meeting\n-
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 -------------------\nUnited States Toll: +1-415-655-0002\nUnited States Tol
 l (New York City): +1-646-992-2010\n\nHaving trouble dialing in? Try these 
 backup numbers:\nUnited States Toll: +1-415-655-0002\nGlobal call-in number
 s: https://fcnit.webex.com/fcnit/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&eventID=10
 22043762&tollFree=0\nAttendee access code: 247 146 11\n* United States Toll
  should only be used if the primary number does not work.  \n\n------------
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------\nTo join the online portion of the Personal Conference meeting\n--
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ------------------\n1. Go to https://fcnit.webex.com/fcnit/j.php?MTID=m29d6
 38a1f95748e41f840ae8fbc929db\n2. If a password is required\, enter the Meet
 ing Password: 24714611\n\n-------------------------------------------------
