DESCRIPTION:Good Afternoon Bob and Scott\,<br><br>We look forward to provid
 ing you with a virtual tour on Friday at 1:30.&nbsp\; We use Google Meets f
 or these tours\, so please let me know if you have any issues getting into 
 the meeting and I will try to reach out to you directly to dial you in.&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;<br><br>Agenda for Tour:&nbsp\;<br><ul><li>Introductions&nbsp\;</
 li><li>Overview of Iron Mountain and Manassas Facility history</li><li>Camp
 us Safety &amp\; Security&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</li><li>Compliance program<
 /li><li>First Floor layout - Lobby/Loading Dock</li><li>Shipping and Receiv
 ing - Loading Dock</li><li>Pathways and mantraps</li><li>Data Hall</li><li>
 Support Galleys</li><li>Common space and office space</li><li>Smart Hands</
 li><li>Migration Services</li><li>Networking - Carriers and cloud on-rampin
 g</li><li>Connectivity options</li><li>Action Items and next steps</li></ul
 >\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/bkc-jqmk-tew\nOr dial: 
 (US) +1 219-321-0452 PIN: 230374137#\nMore joining options: https://tel.mee
 t/bkc-jqmk-tew?pin=7094621047884&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://
 support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
