CREATED:20220930T152527Z
DESCRIPTION:Troy\,\n\nI had a blast tonight!\n\nThanks so much for everythi
 ng it was awesome....\n\n\nAs we discussed tonight  I would like to introdu
 ce Energy Efficient Technologies  to Iron Mountain.\n\nEnergy Efficient is 
 doing work in data centers and has a track record of producing.\n\nI am hop
 ing they will help Iron Mountain succeed in saving money & improve efficien
 cy.\n\nI look forward to hearing if there may be the opportunity to introdu
 ce Joe at a meeting in Manassas. \n\nI get nothing out of this except intro
 ducing two companies I think are doing great things!\n\nThanks so much\,\n\
 nJohn\n\nJohn Jewell (JJ) \n\nDirector Legislative Affairs & Special Progra
 ms \n\nCell: 202 359-5071 \n\nFCN is a Woman-Owned Small Business \n\nSEWP 
 V Contract-Category C\n...\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.co
 m/sjh-qonk-qhi\nOr dial: (US) +1 352-888-6516 PIN: 170859129#\nMore joining
  options: https://tel.meet/sjh-qonk-qhi?pin=9649638967988&hs=7\n\nLearn mor
 e about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20221025T195604Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:hold - energy efficient technologies / Iron Mountain
TRANSP:OPAQUE
