DESCRIPTION:Good afternoon:\n\nPlease join us as we welcome Senator Tim Kai
 ne for a tour of Henry F. Sliwinski Water Treatment Plant!  We are excited 
 to share the continued progress of the Opequon Water Supply Plan\, which su
 pports Frederick Water’s mission of providing affordable and reliable water
  to our community.\n\nThe tour will begin at the Cole Field parking lot in 
 Stonewall Park.   It is a construction site\, so please dress accordingly. 
  Hard hats and safety vests will be provided.\n\nPlease feel free to contac
 t me with any questions.  We hope to see you there!\n\nWarm regards\,\n\nJa
 mie McFadden\n\n[A sign in a factory  Description automatically generated w
 ith low confidence]\n\n____________________________________________________
