DESCRIPTION:Topic: Powering Virginia’s Data Center Growth and Rising Energy
  Demand: Strategic & Economic Opportunities\nDescription: One of Virginia’s
  most urgent challenges is meeting the surge in electricity demand\, driven
  by rapid growth in data centers\, AI\, electrification\, and manufacturing
 .\n \nChambers and economic development organizations have a critical role 
 to play in ensuring Virginia’s businesses and communities have access to re
 liable\, cost-effective power.\n\nDiscussion topics will explore:\n\n- What
 ’s driving Virginia’s unprecedented electricity demand \n- Solutions to mee
 ting rising demand\, including clean energy’s \nunique advantages in speed 
 of buildout and keeping utility rates low\n- Strategies for balancing sitin
 g\, permitting and land use with economic priorities\n- How chambers and ED
 Os can shape Virginia’s energy choices to strengthen business competitivene
 ss and attract investment\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, iPad\, or Android:\nhttps
 ://us02web.zoom.us/w/81964781665?tk=_i6CzCMlRcg4qgxIxZ_e25BddnetXyA3ymtwDDE
