DESCRIPTION:Good morning\,\n\nThis meeting will be an opportunity to discus
 s Apple Blossom Festival Planning with City\, County\, State\, and Festival
  Folks present.  Microsoft Teams is available for those who cannot attend i
 n person. A snapshot of the meeting schedule is below.  Hope to see everyon
 e at the Frederick County Public Safety Building on 1/23.\n\n\n  1.  Review
  Event Schedule\, discuss updates\n  2.  Weather/Safety Policy Updates\n  3
 .  2025 AAR High-Level Review\n  4.  Tabletop Exercise Discussion\n  5.  Ag
 ency questions and concerns\n\n\nThanks\,\nEthan\n\nEthan Longenecker\, VaP
 EM\, MS\nEmergency Management Coordinator\nCity of Winchester\n301 E. Cork 
 Street\nWinchester\, VA 22601\nPrimary Cell: 540-336-0713\nAlternate Cell: 
 540-818-4478\nOffice: 540-773-1352\nethan.longenecker@winchesterva.gov<mail
 to:ethan.longenecker@winchesterva.gov>\n[cid:image001.png@01DC6A77.2F473300
 ]\n\n\n____________________________________________________________________
