DESCRIPTION:January 23\, 2025: Connecting Quality and Caring – High Quality
  Care and the Patient Experience\n\n\n·         If you are able\, please ar
 rive at 7:45 a.m. for the session\, as you will need extra time to change i
 nto scrubs prior to our session beginning at 8 a.m.\n\n·         This will 
 be an operating room (OR) experience\, please note that it is not uncommon 
 to get lightheaded in the OR – be sure to eat a light breakfast before you 
 arrive.\n\n·         Please wear comfortable shoes (NO high heels or open-t
 oed shoes).\n\n·         Please leave all valuables – including wallets\, p
 urses and bags – in your vehicle (out of plain sight)\; if possible\, arriv
 e with only your keys and cell phone.\n\n·         Please park in the Green
  lot at WMC (1840 Amherst St\, Winchester\, VA 22601) and use the South Tow
 er entrance to the hospital\; we will meet in the South Tower lobby. Here i
 s a map of campus: Valley Health WMC Campus Map<https://www.valleyhealthlin
 k.com/sub/66301/documents/WMC-Color-Map-exterior-interior-5.22.pdf>\; it wo
 uld be easiest to enter off Route 50 via Entrance 1 and take a left at the 
 stop sign and then a right into the Green lot.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20250123T124215Z
LOCATION:Winchester Medical Center South Tower Lobby (1840 Amherst St\, Win
 chester\, VA 22601)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Valley Health Connect Program - Session 4
