 ssom Festival® Volunteer Party—a celebration of all the hard work and dedic
 ation that made this year’s Festival a success!<u></u><u></u></p><p><u></u>
  <u></u></p><p>Date:                    <b>Thursday\, June 19 (please note 
 the date change\, this was originally scheduled for June 12)</b><br>Locatio
 n:            Millwood Station 252 Costello Dr. Winchester\, VA<br>Time:<u>
 </u><u></u></p><ul><li>5:00 PM – Annual Meeting (for Board Members &amp\; D
 epartment Chairs)<u></u><u></u></li><li>5:30 PM – Party Begins<br>Dinner wi
 ll be served!<u></u><u></u></li></ul><p><u></u> <u></u></p><p>Please invite
  all of your committee members to join us. To ensure the best experience fo
 r all guests\, attendance is limited\, and we are unable to accommodate plu
 s-ones.</p>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/bwe-ngux-dpp\
 n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282
 720
