DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nWe are looking forward to meeting with everyone toni
 ght. With the weather being unpredictable\, we wanted to offer the option t
 o join the meeting virtually via Microsoft Teams if you’re not comfortable 
 traveling tonight. We do still plan to meet in person but wanted to make th
 is option available. Please let us know if you plan to join virtually.\n\nT
 he in-person meeting will be held at First Bank\, 1835 Valley Avenue\, in t
 he second-floor conference room. Please see the schedule below for your ass
 igned meeting time.\n\n5:30pm Family Fun Night\n6:00pm Business at the Bloo
 m\n6:30pm Sports Breakfast\n7:00pm Veterans Dinner\n7:30pm Bloomers\n8:00pm
  Jimmy Buffett\, Disco and Country\n\n\n___________________________________
