DESCRIPTION:\n------------\n                    From:       Jason Aikens\n 
                    Sent:       Friday\, February 20\, 2026 6:01 AM\n       
              To: Nicholas Sabo\n                    Cc: John  Jewell\; Will
 iam Pifer\n                    Subject:    Re: Project Skyforge EDA Incenti
 ve Meeting\n\n                    Follow Up Flag:     Follow up\n          
           Flag Status:        Flagged\n\nGood morning\, Nick -\n\nThank you
  for the note. It would be great to get together as I would like to learn m
 ore about the airport and the project.\n\nI could meet you at the airport i
 f you would like\, to give me a “lay of the land” on 3/4 @ 9:00 or 3/5 @ 11
 :00.\n\nLet me know what works best for you.\n\n\nJason Aikens\n\nGainesbor
 o Supervisor\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Nicholas Sabo <nsabo@flyokv.com<mailto:nsabo@fl
 yokv.com>>\nDate: Wednesday\, February 18\, 2026 at 11:12 AM\nTo: Jason Aik
 ens <jason.aikens@fcva.us<mailto:jason.aikens@fcva.us>>\nCc: John Jewell <j
 ohn.jewell@fcva.us<mailto:john.jewell@fcva.us>>\, William Pifer <bpifer.bpp
 roperties@gmail.com<mailto:bpifer.bpproperties@gmail.com>>\nSubject: RE: Pr
 oject Skyforge EDA Incentive Meeting\n\n\n\nSupervisor Aikens\,\n\n\n\nOn b
 ehalf of the Winchester Regional Airport Authority\, we want to extend a he
 artfelt (although slightly delayed) welcome to the BOS.  We look forward to
  working with you!\n\n\n\nI would appreciate an opportunity to meet with yo
 u to discuss the airport\, our history and recent progress\, and the projec
 t referenced in the email thread below.  Please let me know when your sched
 ule allows for a visit to the airport\, or I am happy to meet somewhere for
  coffee.\n\n\n\nThanks for your time and I look forward to hearing back fro
 m you.\n\n\n\nNick\n\n\n\nNicholas Sabo\, A.A.E.\n\nExecutive Director\n\nW
 inchester Regional Airport Authority\n\n491 Airport Road\, Winchester\, VA 
 22602\n\nwww.flyokv.com<https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fwww.flyokv.com%2F&data=05%7C02%7C%7C49492f440c2e4241b73a08de7
 06f63fc%7C0201b765070d4db084226cfc27f09889%7C0%7C0%7C639071820896304734%7CU
 nknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW
 4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=ONTzB%2Fmtr2o4muP
 ylBly6hhgr92geSQru%2F5nZbShJxs%3D&reserved=0> | 540-662-5786\n\n\n\n\n\nVIR
 GINIA FREEDOM OF INFORMATION ACT NOTICE: This e-mail and any of its attachm
 ents may constitute a public record under the Virginia Freedom of Informati
 on Act. Accordingly\, the sender and/or recipient listed above may be requi
 red to produce this e-mail and any of its attachments to any requester unle
 ss certain limited and very specific exemptions are applicable.\n\n\n\nFrom
 : John Jewell <john.jewell@fcva.us<mailto:john.jewell@fcva.us>>\nSent: Tues
 day\, December 23\, 2025 2:19 PM\nTo: Michael Bollhoefer <michael.bollhoefe
 r@fcva.us<mailto:michael.bollhoefer@fcva.us>>\nCc: Jay Tibbs <jtibbs@fcva.u
 s<mailto:jtibbs@fcva.us>>\; John Jewell <john.jewell@fcva.us<mailto:john.je
 well@fcva.us>>\; Nicholas Sabo <nsabo@flyokv.com<mailto:nsabo@flyokv.com>>\
 ; Jason Aikens <jason.aikens@fcva.us<mailto:jason.aikens@fcva.us>>\nSubject
 : Project Skyforge EDA Incentive Meeting\n\n\n\nHi Mike\,\n\n\n\nI met with
  Nick\, Bill Fifer\, and Gene Fisher to discuss Project Skyforge today.\n\n
 \n\nIt is my understanding that when the EDA puts together an incentive pac
 kage the meeting is with you\, Jay\, Rick Till & Patrick before the BOS hea
 rs anything about it.\n\n\n\nThis project will be a joint venture with the 
 Winchester Airport Authority and the county.  I also  understand this needs
  to be on a fast track….\n\nI want to make sure Nick\; Jason and I are incl
 uded in any meetings regarding incentive packages for this project before t
 hey are presented to the entire BOS.\n\n\n\nI have included Nick and Jason 
 on this email and discussed with both being involved in the process.\n\n\n\
 nHave a very Merry Christmas & A Happy New Year\,\n\n\n\nJohn\n\n\n\nJohn J
 ewell\n\nChairman\, Frederick County Board of Supervisors\n\nCell: 202 359-
 5071\n\nJohn.jewell@fcva.us<mailto:John.jewell@fcva.us>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
