DESCRIPTION:Good morning\,\n\nThis meeting will be the second and final App
 le Blossom Festival coordination meeting with City\, County\, State\, and F
 estival Folks present.  Microsoft Teams is available for those who cannot a
 ttend in person. A snapshot of the meeting schedule is below.  Hope to see 
 everyone at the Frederick County Public Safety Building on 4/17.\n\n\n  1. 
  Final event updates\n  2.  Tabletop Exercise Follow Up\n  3.  Weather/Emer
 gency Procedure Review\n  4.  Agency questions and concerns\n  5.  Distribu
 tion of passes\n\n\nThanks\,\nEthan\n\nEthan Longenecker\, VaPEM\, MS\nEmer
 gency Management Coordinator\nCity of Winchester\n301 E. Cork Street\nWinch
 ester\, VA 22601\nPrimary Cell: 540-336-0713\nAlternate Cell: 540-818-4478\
 nOffice: 540-773-1352\nethan.longenecker@winchesterva.gov<mailto:ethan.long
 enecker@winchesterva.gov>\n[cid:image001.png@01DC6A81.9F5F2350]\n\n\n\n____
