DESCRIPTION:James\, Scott and Vik\,\n\nThank you in advance for taking the 
 time to meet with us. We truly appreciate your engagement and look forward 
 to a great conversation.\n\nWe are looking forward to the opportunity to di
 scuss the Your responses will help us tailor the conversation directly to y
 our office's needs.\nopportunity and explore how a modern CSS solution can 
 best serve your offices and the constituents you represent.\n\nAgenda\n\n  
 *   Overview of the CSS opportunity and Maximus' approach\n  *   Discussion
  of key capabilities and features\n  *   Your priorities and must-haves in 
 a CSS solution\n  *   Q&A and next steps\n\nQuick Survey — Share Your Prior
 ities\nTo make the most of our time together\, we'd love to hear from you a
 head of the meeting. Please take a few minutes to complete this short surve
 y on the features\, capabilities\, and requirements most important to your 
 office in a CSS solution. Your input will help us better understand your of
 fice's priorities and ensure our discussion is focused on what matters most
  to you. Your responses will help us tailor the conversation directly to yo
 ur office's needs.\n\nhttps://app.opinionx.co/ecf2c80f-9a15-47f8-9cbb-253ff
 da96ddc\n\nWe look forward to connecting and learning more about how we can
  support the Senate CSS mission. Please don't hesitate to reach out if you 
 have any questions in the meantime.\n\n\n__________________________________
 ______________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJo
 in: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/210724105257772?p=GDLSoIgSdhjEmqFtc0\n
 Meeting ID: 210 724 105 257 772\nPasscode: MV3sN9dJ\n______________________
