DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Washington vs. Dallas Watch Party on Sunday\, S
 eptember 20 at the Our Health Kendall Community Campus GreenSpace. Tailgati
 ng kicks off at 3:00 PM\, followed by the big game at 4:00 PM. With delicio
 us food\, local craft beer\, and appearances by former NFL players\, this h
 igh-energy afternoon is more than just a game\, it's an experience. Guests 
 can enjoy raffles\, exciting prizes\, and the chance to bid on exclusive sp
 orts memorabilia\, all while supporting a great cause. Proceeds from the ev
 ent benefit Our Health and help fund programs that connect individuals and 
 families to critical health and human services throughout the Northern Shen
 andoah Valley. Tickets are $100 and space is limited\, don't miss your chan
 ce to be part of this unforgettable fall event.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T121234Z
LOCATION:329 N Cameron St\, Winchester\, VA 22601\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Washington vs. Dallas Watch Party
